Subject: [PATCH 03/13] Reland "[Media] Don't retry network failures which are
 deterministic"

This is a reland of commit 3ea93124568e116f89d7493360b8e7257c78e186, there are no changes since it wasn't the culprit for failures.

Original change's description:
> [Media] Don't retry network failures which are deterministic
>
> These will never succeed so retrying just allows information
> exposure.
>
